WEBVTT

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.730
He's gone...

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.940
Miss Ireena.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:13.240
We kind of keep getting 
left behind, don't we?

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.680
True.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.910
I feel like we've been completely 
lacking a reason to be here so far.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.180
We wouldn't be able to do anything 
if we went on the battlefield...

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.830
I know that's true,

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.540
but I don't want to admit it.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:29.960
Still,

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.920
we're not going to take the 
option of giving up, right?

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.140
Naturally!

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.340
If only you would give up,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:46.450
then I could make smooth progress on 
the 10,000 Person Ardy Harem Plan.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.720
I won't accept any harems!

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.070
And wait, you just increased how 
many are in it, didn't you?!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.200
Miss Ireena. Miss Ginny.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.780
I have an important announcement.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.760
An important...

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.870
...announcement?

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.080
Yes.

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:05.660
At Sir Ard's orders,

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.830
you two are to depart at once.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:14.010
Does that mean there's 
something that we can do?

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.290
Yeah!

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:22.600
Miss Latima, could you please explain?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:27.690
Our deployment is part of the 
operation Sir Ard devised.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.640
Sir Ard has uncovered the truth 
behind the Demon Lord's immortality,

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:36.360
and he ordered me to head to the castle 
occupied by the Demon Lord with you two

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.700
when the appropriate time came.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:41.660
Why did he tell you, 
instead of telling us directly?

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.370
Because it was important to 
act under absolute secrecy.

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:52.520
Then could you tell us what the plan is?

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:55.130
Sir Ard theorizes that the 
Demon Lord's immortality

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:58.870
results from the use of a secret 
soul-separation technique.

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:00.900
Secret soul-separation technique?

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.180
You mean that thing?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.810
The kind that separates 
the soul from the body...?

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:08.770
And seals it into an appropriate vessel.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:13.810
Death requires both the loss of the 
soul and the body at the same time,

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:17.490
so separating the two makes 
one practically immortal.

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:20.450
So then?

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.490
According to Sir Ard,

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:25.340
there are two drawbacks to that technique.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:30.420
One is that the user must never be more than 
a certain distance away from the vessel.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:35.380
The other is that if their vessel is ever 
destroyed, they lose their immortality.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.500
So he surmises that the Demon Lord 
moved the vessel along with his soul

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.060
to the castle that he's occupied.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.390
Now that you mention it,

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.390
Lord Varvatos did mention during the meeting

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.080
that they would win once they reached the castle.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:53.480
So we've been entrusted with the secret 
mission of destroying that vessel?

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.700
That is correct.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:03:00.720
The battle currently being carried 
out under Lord Varvatos's direction

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.780
is nothing more than a diversion.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.650
Though no one knows that's the case.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:11.400
Sir Ard discovered a secret 
passage into the castle.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.880
We'll be using that.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.170
But why us?

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.130
Why leave such a major role to us?

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.430
That's not very like you, Miss Ireena.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.640
You're usually the type to be 
overjoyed at moments like this.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.160
If Ardy found out you were so weak,

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.860
I'm sure he'd be disappointed.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:37.660
Wha?!

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.750
D-Don't say stupid things!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.070
There's no way he'd be disappointed in me.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:48.540
Uh-huh, that attitude suits you much better.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:56.210
At times like these, you should just go 
"Yay! Hooray!" and celebrate without a care.

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:00.170
Yeah, you're right! That's true!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.920
I'll do this!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.550
Step back!

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:12.690
Latima!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.780
Please go on!

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.900
I'll hold the enemies back!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.730
Hurry! Go on!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.580
Got it!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.610
Let's push forward and conquer!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:13.280
Jeez, Big Sis Lydia, where did you go off to?

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:16.920
I wish you'd tell me when you'll be back!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.950
That's...

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.440
There's no mistake.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:30.970
It's the vessel housing 
the Demon Lord's soul.

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:36.250
Let's do this, Ginny!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:36.850
Yes!

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:51.950
Why, you!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.160
What? What's this?

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.100
It's no use.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:01.840
That restraint spell also 
seals away your magic power.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.670
Why?!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.550
What's going on here,

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:09.660
Latima?!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.180
Miss Ireena! Miss Ginny!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.310
Now, those are some familiar faces.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.770
I thought I'd never get 
to see those two again.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:27.460
Let me make this boring excuse for you anyway.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.990
If you value the hostages' 
lives, then join my army.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:35.200
And what will happen to them if I say no?

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.520
Nothing will happen.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.820
I already told you.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.920
This is nothing more than a farce.

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:45.630
So you have no intention of harming them?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:50.180
Are you really just trying 
to give me an excuse?

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:54.600
To let me say I had to join you 
in order to save the hostages?

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.830
I already know what you're thinking.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.440
And how Lydia feels, too.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.120
I'm sure that when she does die,

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.040
she'll be filled with satisfaction

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.070
instead of lament and regret.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:07.840
However...

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.840
What about how we feel?

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.120
We had to kill our best 
friend with our own hands.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:15.280
We encouraged her to do 
what would lead to that.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.270
Bearing that sin for all eternity is just...!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:22.160
Even if Lydia did long for a miserable end,

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:27.250
isn't it only natural that we 
would long for her to be happy?

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:32.010
I'll be taking many lives 
to ensure that Lydia lives.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:36.440
I'll probably even drive the 
world to the brink of ruin.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:39.170
However, if that's what 
it takes to save Lydia,

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:40.950
then it's a cheap price to pay!

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:45.480
The lives of others mean nothing to me now!

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:50.400
A part of you, deep in your heart, 
feels the same way, right?

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:53.360
So then why hesitate?

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.100
If you must still continue to hesitate,

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.250
then I'll give you another excuse.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:05.690
I may not do anything to harm those girls,

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:13.220
but I can't guarantee what will happen to them 
when the Varvatos's army reaches this castle.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.680
Wha?! Are you threatening me?!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:20.420
So even putting your vessel here was 
all part of your calculated plan?

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:24.020
Hmph! Let me put even more plainly.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:28.740
If you don't want to lose 
those two, then join me.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.900
Why are you doing this?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.200
The reason for my actions is simple.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.370
Lady Lydia.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.790
Wh-What do you mean?

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.950
There's no need for you two to know that.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:48.650
In the end, you two are simply 
tools to manipulate Ard Meteor.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:50.750
Just be quiet while you're put to use.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.210
My goodness, how troublesome.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:59.290
Your biggest weakness is that 
fragile mentality of yours.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.410
Since you always so arrogantly 
believe that you can do anything,

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:07.380
your ability to think completely 
stops when you're in a pinch.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.230
But I'm different.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:13.960
Being in a pinch was a natural 
part of my daily life,

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.780
so I'm able to break out of this situation.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:21.740
What could you two possibly do 
when you can't even use magic?

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.790
That's true.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.970
We can't use magic.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:28.960
Though what about atypical magic?

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.250
Short...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.460
...Flare...

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.630
...Bomb!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.080
Honestly, you tick me off!

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:41.310
I'll take that as praise.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.270
Unexpected though that was, 
it's not a problem.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.980
All of your efforts shall end in vain.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:02.700
No matter how many you call upon, 
they're no match for us!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:07.660
Once we're finished with the opening 
act, you're next, Miss Latima.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.460
Is that so?

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:14.110
Then there's only one action I should take!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:16.010
Now this sounds interesting.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.010
Let me in on this, would you?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.560
Hmph! Come on,

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.100
call up something that 
puts up a better fight.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.520
Why are you here, Lady Lydia?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.280
Those hairpins I gave you?

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:37.820
They're magic equipment with a spell 
that monitors your current status.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.990
They held such a power?

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.020
Give it up, Latima!

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:46.590
N-No! Even if you...

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:49.160
No, all the more so because it's for you!

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:54.920
This world can go to ruin 
if it means saving you!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:57.880
Yeah.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.630
I guess all of you would feel that way.

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:11.850
You dumbass.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:16.540
Lady Lydia, I...

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.700
Every single one of you...

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.860
I'd be lying if I said 
it didn't make me happy.

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:32.460
But I'm prepared to accept 
whatever fate befalls me.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.560
I'm fighting to protect the 
hopes and dreams of others

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:40.930
and to create a world where 
everyone can live with a smile!

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:47.880
Once I've accomplished that, I'll disappear 
after seeing everyone's smiles.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.470
That's what it means to be Champion.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:54.650
In the end, I'll bear the full responsibility 
and sin of all our bloodshed

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.360
and go to Hell.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.440
That's what it means to be Champion.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:04.410
And I'm the Champion before 
I'm your best friend.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.790
So I'll live like the Champion 
and die like the Champion.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:16.960
So don't you go living life always 
looking back, you big dumbass!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.560
Lydia!

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.240
What?

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:32.040
It's over already.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.390
Your plan is ruined.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.280
It's not over yet!

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.150
You only robbed me of my immortality!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.640
Even if I'm defeated in this battle,

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:44.650
so long as you join me, I'll...!

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.370
You already know what 
my answer is, don't you?

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:54.660
My alter ego, do you 
truly wish to save Lydia?

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:56.370
What?

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:59.840
Are you sure you aren't just trying to run?

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.240
What you truly want

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:06.030
is to save yourself from 
the guilt of slaying Lydia.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.990
You want to forgive 
yourself and die in peace.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:13.390
You're just using Lydia 
toward that end, aren't you?

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:14.850
What?!

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:16.410
Coward!

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:19.240
Both you and I have always acted 
on our own selfish feelings

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:21.690
without thinking about how others feel!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:26.040
So why not truly do something for someone 
else for the first time in our lives?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.410
We should work to honor Lydia's wishes!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.450
Shut up!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.930
Yeah, that's right!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.300
That's right!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.130
I do want to forgive myself! Save myself!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.240
But even so!

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:43.380
I won't let you deny how I feel about Lydia!

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.390
This is the end for you!

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:51.600
The path of old is despair.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.310
That is the life of a pathetic man.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.640
Even though there are those who follow him,

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.350
None rule together with him.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.360
Surely that will be...

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:12.860
A Private Kingdom!

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.730
Why did you end your own life?!

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.200
Was it not because you 
couldn't endure the solitude?

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.930
How dare someone like you 
accuse me of running?!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.960
Have you forgotten our 
last words with Lydia?!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.780
Th-There's no way I ever could!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.650
You bastard! What are you thinking?!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.290
What do you mean?

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:50.560
Why are you thinking, accepting 
their demand for a ceasefire?!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.310
Are you insane?!

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:54.620
Obviously I'm sane.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:58.260
We'll agree to a ceasefire and enter 
into a non-aggression treaty.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.330
We'll allow them to govern their own land,

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:04.960
and while we won't recognize the 
formation of a demon nation,

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.710
we'll tolerate it.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.860
How can you trust them?!

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.160
There'll just be more 
fighting again in no time!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.100
We should crush them right now!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.510
Now is our chance!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:20.290
I don't plan on changing my mind, 
no matter what you say.

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.840
Screw you!

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:25.480
I thought we shared the same ambition!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.690
You traitor!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:32.200
And have you ever stopped 
to consider how I feel?

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.460
I don't give a damn how you feel!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:38.890
If you want to fight them that badly, 
then do it on your own!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.850
I don't care what you do anymore!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.930
I never should have said such things to her!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.310
I never intended to say them!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.920
I should have been honest

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:03.560
and told her how I truly felt,

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.980
how I didn't want her to die!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.890
Coming to an end like that...

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:13.200
I'll never accept that Lydia had 
to face such a miserable end!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.170
That's why I'll save Lydia

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:19.150
and seek judgment at Lydia's hands!

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.620
Lydia deserves happiness!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.060
<i>I see.</i>

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.820
<i>If that's what you wish, then—</i>

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:04.500
It's over, Disaster Rogue, my alter ego.

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:10.460
Do you truly believe that 
this is for the best?

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.420
Please, remember...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.790
the days we spent with Lydia.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.520
And just how

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:19.390
precious they were.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.410
Please.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:34.780
Please.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.370
I can't fail,

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.700
not this time...

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.740
I only truly understood after I lost her...

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.660
How I felt for Lydia.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:49.270
That's why I want to save her.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:53.380
I loved her.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:04.510
You are committing that same sin once again!

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:05.740
Don't forget that!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.630
Once more...

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:13.530
Once more you are killing 
Lydia with your hands!

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:24.970
What's this?

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.450
Looks like you're going home.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:34.050
Well, guess that's best for you guys.

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:38.010
Lady Lydia, you knew about us?

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:40.970
Kind of.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:02.030
Hey, can I ask you all one thing?

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.410
What's the future like?

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:09.950
Is the world a place where 
everyone can live with a smile?

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.510
The future...

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:21.170
The future is a wonderful world, 
just like you longed for, Lady Lydia!

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.940
I have fun every day,

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.930
and even though we sometimes fight,

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.390
we're all happy.

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:32.100
I do think it's a world 
where everyone's smiling!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.050
I see.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:37.600
Then our sacrifice wasn't all for naught.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:41.920
Can I ask you to convey 
one last thing for me?

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:45.340
It seems there are a few things 
I need to say to Ard.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:46.740
Ah!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.640
What is this?

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:05.510
I have a message.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.640
We have put the Demon Lord's army to rout!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.680
Is that true?!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.350
Was it them?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.280
Pursue!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:19.380
Don't let a single one escape!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.450
Men, settle down!

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.390
Our army has won.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:28.140
Pursuing them any further is pointless.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.280
Good job.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.990
There was nothing I did this time.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.140
Aside from having talented subordinates.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:50.000
What happened to Ard Meteor?

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.310
Was he not with you?

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:55.700
He went home.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:58.360
To where he belongs.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.320
I see.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:05.200
So it's over.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:09.580
No, it's just begun.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:20.690
I can't help but feel utterly impressed at 
your wonderful completion of your mission.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.580
Who are you people, really?

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:27.400
Would you mind telling me 
what it is you're after?

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:30.360
There are no words to express who we are.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.790
Though I hope you'll believe me on this—

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:37.310
At the very least, I'm your ally.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:43.400
Still, I pray that we never see you again.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.960
You and I both.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.120
Ard Meteor.

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.700
Ard Meteor, we're here. Wake up.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.840
Wake up already!

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.040
Good grief! Jeez!

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.300
All three of you sleep too soundly!

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:09.940
Come on, hurry up and get out.

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:13.430
The other students have already 
started making their way there.

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:15.140
Hup!

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:17.720
This is so nostalgic!

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:20.240
The old royal capital, Kingsglaive!

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:22.610
It hasn't changed much around here.

00:22:23.470 --> 00:22:25.540
A lot of things happened to us...

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.630
But we're back home now.

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:29.520
That's right, Ard!

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:32.900
Lady Lydia left a message 
for you when we departed.

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:34.790
A message?

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:36.790
Yeah. Um...

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:41.350
No matter what comes, 
no matter what happens to us,

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.940
we'll always be best friends.

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:49.010
Miss Ireena!

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:51.560
What are you doing?

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:52.720
I'm coming now!

00:22:57.730 --> 00:22:58.650
Huh?!

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:29.140
Lydia, thank you.
